<title>UK: GSI sets warrants on Clariant shares.</title>
<headline>GSI sets warrants on Clariant shares.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs International said it has issued two million American-style call warrants, on Clariant registered shares.</p>
<p>One share is controlled by 10 warrants.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    700 CHF		   PREMIUM	14.32 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     7.05 CHF		  GEARING	9.56 X</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 26.FEB.97-17.JUL.98   PAYDATE	25.FEB.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   SWISS EXCHANGE	  MIN EXER LOT 500</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  674 CHF</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
